  "notes": "Growth for «الصالحات» (leaving before the punishment), light for «نورا مبينا», hands for «واعتصموا به», footsteps for «صراطا مستقيما»; nothing literal for Paradise. 173:18-26 «ولا يجدون لهم… وليا ولا نصيرا» not glossed (the excerpt would read as a protector). Al-Muyassar's first-person «رسولنا», «وأنزلنا» not used. STAGING v4: 173 stays ambient: the requital of the two groups after the gathering (rewards and the painful punishment, the unseen). 174-175: the address to all people: a mixed group in a town (camera only, nothing acted on the address); light plate for the clear light sent down; then the believers: hands plate on 175:5 (holding fast; no gesture, since the tafsirs word it differently: to Allah / to the light sent down) and they walk forward on 175:14 (guided to a straight path); Paradise is not drawn."
